<title>JORDAN: Jordan seeks 50,000 T wheat for March shipment.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 50,000 T wheat for March shipment.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan will tender on February 5 for 50,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat or equivalent origin for March shipment, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Jordan's Ministry of Supply wants the wheat in one 50,000-tonne lot for shipment by end of March. U.S. wheat would be covered by the GSM 102 programme, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Amman Newsroom +9626-623776</p>
